    "CoiStatement": "Author disclosures: AM is a consultant for and his research is funded, in part, by Danone Nutricia Research. He holds a Canadian Institutes of Health Research (CIHR)/Pfizer research chair on the pathogenesis of insulin resistance and cardiovascular diseases. AT serves on the Yogurt in Nutrition Initiative for Health Advisory Board for Danone Institute International and on the board of the Danone Institute of Canada. His research has been funded, in part, by Dairy Farmers of Canada, the Dairy Research Institute of the United States, Danone, Wyeth Consumer Healthcare, Nestlé, General Mills, and Lallemand. He has also been partly funded over the last years by the Canada Research Chair in Environment and Energy Balance and the Government of Quebec. SP is a co-investigator on the 2015 Yogurt in Nutrition Initiative grant, has previously received an honorarium from Danone Nutricia Research unrelated to this work, and is also the recipient of a postdoctoral fellowship from the Canadian Diabetes Association. MAF is a CIHR Fellow, and her salary is paid, in part, through a research grant from Danone International. ND is involved in a research project with Danone Nutricia Research but receives no salary from the company and is a recipient of a Jean-Paul-Houle doctoral award from the Laval University School of Nutrition.",
